    },
    {
      "text": "Inputs cover text, image, audio, and video, with up to 1M tokens of context and text output up to 64K tokens.",
      "pages": [2],
      "document": "google-gemini-3-6-flash"
    },
    {
      "text": "The benchmark chart reports improvements over its predecessor on SWE-bench Pro, DeepSWE v1.1, MLE-Bench, OSWorld-Verified, and MRCR v2.",
      "pages": [4],
      "document": "google-gemini-3-6-flash"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intended-use section names agent workflows, video-heavy reasoning, coding help, and enterprise workflows.",
